==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 4~24 seconds<sup>120f~720f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 90~94 seconds<sup>2,700f~2,820f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 4~12 seconds<sup>120f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 60~64 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,920f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Dashing Face]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Dashing Face has very short range, standing only at 170, plus he drops a ton of money when killed. Stacking [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] will dispose of him quickly.

